urselves "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[2]},{"t":" who are "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and prudent and well attested, according to your "},{"t":"tribes","s":["H7626"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and I will "},{"t":"make","s":["H7760"],"a":[7]},{"t":" them your leaders."}]},{"n":14,"text":"And you answered me and said, The thing that you have said to do is good.","tok":[{"t":"And you "},{"t":"answered","s":["H6030"],"a":[0]},{"t":" me and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"thing","s":["H1697"],"a":[4]},{"t":" that you have said to "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[7]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[3]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"So I took the leaders of your tribes, men who were wise and well attested, and I made them leaders over you, captains over thousands and captains over hundreds and captains over fifties and captains over tens and officials for your tribes.","tok":[{"t":"So I "},{"t":"took","s":["H3947"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the leaders of your "},{"t":"tribes","s":["H7626"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[4]},{"t":" who were "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and well attested, and I "},{"t":"made","s":["H5414"],"a":[7]},{"t":" them leaders over you, "},{"t":"captains","s":["H8269"],"a":[11]},{"t":" over "},{"t":"thousands","s":["H0505"],"a":[12]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"captains","s":["H8269"],"a":[13]},{"t":" over "},{"t":"hundreds","s":["H3967"],"a":[14]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"captains","s":["H8269"],"a":[15]},{"t":" over "},{"t":"fifties","s":["H2572"],"a":[16]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"captains","s":["H8269"],"a":[17]},{"t":" over "},{"t":"tens","s":["H6235"],"a":[18]},{"t":" and officials for your "},{"t":"tribes","s":["H7626"],"a":[20]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"And I charged your judges at that time, saying, Hear the cases between your brothers, and judge righteously between a man and his brother or the sojourner with him.","tok":[{"t":"And I "},{"t":"charged","s":["H6680"],"a":[0]},{"t":" your