":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"fathers","s":["H0001"],"a":[13]},{"t":" has spoken to you. Do not "},{"t":"fear","s":["H3372"],"a":[16]},{"t":", neither be dismayed."}]},{"n":22,"text":"Then all of you came near to me and said, Let us send men before us that they may search out the land for us and bring back to us word concerning the way by which we should go up and the cities into which we should go.","tok":[{"t":"Then all of you came "},{"t":"near","s":["H7126"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to me and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Let us "},{"t":"send","s":["H7971"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[6]},{"t":" us that they may search "},{"t":"out","s":["H2658"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[10]},{"t":" for us and "},{"t":"bring","s":["H7725"],"a":[11]},{"t":" back to us "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"concerning","s":["H7725"]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[15]},{"t":" by which we should go "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[17]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[20]},{"t":" into which we should go."}]},{"n":23,"text":"And the thing pleased me, so I took twelve men from among you, one for each tribe.","tok":[{"t":"And the thing pleased me, so I "},{"t":"took","s":["H3947"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"twelve","s":["H8147"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from among you, "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[9]},{"t":" for each "},{"t":"tribe","s":["H0376"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":24,"text":"And they turned and went up into the hill country, and they came to the Valley of Eshcol; and they spied out the land.","tok":[{"t":"And they "},{"t":"turned","s":["H6437"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and went "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[1]},{"t":" into the hill country, and they "},{"t":"came","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"Valley","s":["H5158"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Eshcol","s":["H0